/target
*.swp
*.swo
.env
# quecto's per-checkout state is local — except this repository's own
# standard Containerfile, which is the project's and is committed (#2073).
# A `.quecto/` anywhere below the root (a crate run as a project, a test
# leftover) is ignored whole, as it was before the root carve-out.
**/.quecto/
!/.quecto/
/.quecto/*
!/.quecto/containers/
/.quecto/containers/*
!/.quecto/containers/standard/
/.quecto/containers/standard/*
!/.quecto/containers/standard/Containerfile
__pycache__/
*.pyc
